# The raw GlobalBuildingAtlas clip is ~167 MB — above GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# limit — so it is kept local and regenerated by R/02_pull_gba.R. The derived
# per-building table and the municipal aggregate ARE committed.
#
# Pattern is relative to this folder, so it matches data/raw/*.parquet wherever
# git is invoked from. Verified with `git check-ignore -v` against the actual
# file path, not an assumed one.
data/raw/*.parquet
